Package: MSMAHVAR
Type: Package
Title: Markov-Switching Mean-Adjusted VAR Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Angela-Frances", "Ibhade", email = "kiaraibhade@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements EM estimation for mean-adjusted Markov-Switching VAR (MSMAH-VAR) models.
    Supports fitting on simulated or real data, returns regime probabilities, state-dependent coefficients, and covariance matrices.
